<title>NETHERLANDS: Ahold's Schuitema 9-mth net up.</title>
<headline>Ahold's Schuitema 9-mth net up.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1996-11-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>First nine months 1996</p>
<p>(in millions of guilders unless otherwise stated)</p>
<p>    Net per shr (guilders)	   133.15 vs 127.85</p>
<p>    Net profit			    31.9  vs  30.7</p>
<p>    Turnover (billions)		  2.42 vs   2.34</p>
<p>    Operating profit		    39.2  vs  40.2</p>
<p>NOTE - Schuitema, a 73-percent owned wholesaling unit of Koninklijke Ahold NV, said it expected the current results trend to continue in the fourth quarter of 1996.</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000, Fax +31 20 504 5040</p>
